### Key changes:

1. **`Collapsible`** — added `h-full flex flex-col` so it participates in the flex height chain
2. **Body wrapper `<div>`** — changed to `h-full` so it fills the collapsible's content area
3. **`.view-code` div** — added `flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-auto` so it:
